  "description": "For those who like it light and fast: The Lyke CF 10, of our new Light eMTB line, convinces with low weight and maximum ePerformance on the trail. The brand new ultra-light Fazua Ride 60 motor saves weight and provides just the right support on the mountain. This is where you also benefit from the weight-optimized carbon frame with closed downtube and new kinematics. Due to the innovative placement of the motor in the seat tube, the center of gravity is directly above the bottom bracket, which also provides improved handling. Reliable Shimano shifting and braking components, and 140mm Fox Float suspension specification offer you carefree riding pleasure. The Lyke CF 10 is the ideal partner for riders who are looking for extra support and at the same time an agile eMTB.",
